Content-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8

https://www.php.net/archive/2026.php#2026-11-18-1 warns:
> The PHP security team announces upcoming security releases scheduled for
> Thursday, 19 November 2026, between 14:00 and 14:30 UTC.
> 
> These releases are part of PHP’s regular four-week release cycle and will
> address security vulnerabilities affecting all supported PHP versions.
> The highest severity is CRITICAL.
> 
> The issues rated CRITICAL require either non-default configuration or
> uncommon setups.
> 
> Users are strongly encouraged to prepare to upgrade promptly once the
> releases become available. Technical details and fixed version numbers
> will be published alongside the releases.
> 
> Thank you for helping us keep PHP secure. 
